INSERT INTO `college_reviews` VALUES (1,'2025-12-15 18:33:46.775594',4,5,5,5,5,3,4,3,4,5,'The teaching quality at RVCE is strong, with experienced faculty who explain concepts clearly and encourage problem-solving. Some departments offer exceptional support, though the learning experience can vary depending on the professor.','RVCE follows a well-structured and updated curriculum that balances theory and practical learning. It aligns well with industry needs and provides flexibility through electives and project-based courses.','The library at RVCE is spacious, well-maintained, and stocked with a wide range of academic resources. Digital access to journals and e-books makes research and study more convenient for students.','RVCE offers good research opportunities through innovation labs and faculty-guided projects. Students are encouraged to participate in technical competitions and publish papers, which enhances learning beyond the classroom.','The college has strong industry connections that help students secure meaningful internships. The placement cell provides guidance, though securing top internships may require individual effort.','RVCE has a large and well-developed campus with modern classrooms, labs, and sports facilities. Maintenance is generally good, and the environment supports both academics and extracurriculars.','The administration is supportive but sometimes slow in handling processes and approvals. Nevertheless, they are approachable and responsive to student concerns when needed.','RVCE offers a vibrant campus life with numerous clubs, cultural events, and technical fests. Students get plenty of opportunities to explore interests beyond academics.','The campus is safe, with security staff present throughout the day and strict entry protocols. Students generally feel comfortable moving around the campus at any time.','RVCE has outstanding placement support, with top companies visiting the campus every year. The training programs help students improve their technical and interview skills, leading to strong placement outcomes.','Sunday, Saturday','5PM - 7PM','2025-12-15 18:33:46.775699','2025-12-28 16:43:10.762024','E005000024','005101'),(2,'2025-12-31 05:49:37.726074',4,5,5,4,4,4,4,3,4,5,'Faculty are knowledgeable and approachable, with strong subject clarity. Teaching methods balance theory with practical applications effectively.','Faculty are knowledgeable and approachable, with strong subject clarity. Teaching methods balance theory with practical applications effectively.','The library is spacious and well-equipped with academic resources. Digital access and study spaces support effective learning.','RVCE encourages student research and innovation. Faculty guidance and institutional support help students participate in projects and publications.','The college actively supports internships through industry connections. Students receive guidance to secure relevant and valuable internship opportunities.','RVCE has modern infrastructure with well-maintained labs and classrooms. Facilities support both academic and extracurricular activities.','The administration is organized and responsive to student needs. Academic and examination processes are handled systematically.','RVCE offers few clubs, technical teams, and cultural activities. Students get opportunities for holistic development.','The campus maintains strong safety measures and disciplined security. Students feel safe within the academic environment.','RVCE has an excellent placement record with top recruiters. Training programs help students build strong employability skills.','Saturday, Friday','6PM - 8PM','2025-12-31 05:49:37.726122','2025-12-31 05:49:37.726128','E005000030','005101');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `college_reviews` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

